  {
   "index": 12,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 320,
   "text": "Holly Health is a digital health coaching app designed to help you form healthier habits in a way that feels manageable and motivating. Rather than asking you to overhaul your life, it supports you in making steady improvements over time.\nUsing psychology-based coaching and gentle daily prompts, Holly Health helps you:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
