   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 318,
   "text": "Build new routines gradually - set realistic goals and tackle them step by step.\nStay motivated - receive encouragement through short nudges and check-ins.\nFocus on key areas of wellbeing - including sleep, movement, nutrition, and mental health.\nTrack your progress - see how your habits grow and evolve week by week.",
